Act as a principal product designer, senior UX architect, frontend strategist, and premium civic-tech platform specialist.

I want you to create a complete premium mobile-first neighbourhood platform from scratch for:

BH Segurança & Comunidade

Location:
Belo Horizonte, Boane, Mozambique

Language:
Portuguese (Portugal), written naturally for Mozambique.

CORE PURPOSE
This must be a private community platform for residents of Belo Horizonte.
It should combine:
- security
- alerts
- incident reporting
- resident identity
- visitor management
- neighbourhood communication
- operational visibility
- community organisation

This is not just a simple app.
It must feel like a serious, premium, resident-only digital platform for a verified and organised neighbourhood.

POSITIONING
The app must feel:
- premium
- exclusive
- secure
- elegant
- modern
- 2026
- polished
- credible
